{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "eda01c1c369f62b3cb64ce8bf6c80d2f633c45fe0993a24e4d9768e1db3cd800", "ja": "ガールズ＆フレンズ", "zh": "少女与朋友", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8ae7023bfa2a7984da667857e2d925141126d101e8239990fcc58c988f83a2fb", "ja": "地方公演当日。控室にて、可憐は律子に、無\n事に終わったらデートをしてください、と告\nげる。メンバー達とプロデューサーが見守る\n中、ふたりは迷いのない足取りで、ステージ\nへと向かっていくのだった。", "zh": "地方巡演当天。在休息室里，可怜对律子说，\n要是顺利结束了就请和她约会。在其他成员\n与制作人的注视下，两人迈着毫不迟疑的\n步伐，向着舞台走去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9f49e94b55b42828b9df32d29a14d4d40b43730ace284143bf011bc21067ab41", "ja": "（いよいよ地方公演当日！　あずささん達の\n曲が終わったら、いよいよ新曲のお披露目だ……）", "zh": "（终于到地方公演当天了！等三浦小姐她们的歌曲结束后，就要正式公开新歌了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "39d0a51594c7bf8df4a379c0f8f3543a6688686e21fc3a6631948ffdd80e66b5", "ja": "そろそろ出番ね。\n可憐、衣装のチェックをしておきましょう。", "zh": "差不多该上场了。\n可怜，我们先检查一下服装吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "bb5b3f7fd3613128df3b39b0b80d8eeb24fdeeeb7b76915be345423260b909cb", "ja": "は、はい……！　き、今日の律子さん、\nなんだかとってもカワイイです……♪", "zh": "是、是的……！律、律子小姐，今天看起来特别可爱……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "a1d28d56f537fffd2092b8f80d909ee5a29fc6480d44e2a3fb2910c73cd2ee29", "ja": "はいはい、そういうのはいいから。\nほら、こっちを向いて……うん、大丈夫そうね。", "zh": "好了好了，那种话就不用说了。\n来，朝这边转过来……嗯，看起来没什么问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "d2c5358ac25fc3f1a17f0bb1309faf62c3c7329fc0a128a88a8fb19e7c2343a2", "ja": "あれ……律子さんから、なんだかいい香りが……。\nこ、これって……くんくん……。", "zh": "咦……律子小姐身上，好像有股很好闻的香味……  \n这、这是……（嗅嗅）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "2fd4518acb12216090a211be03fee01e30d70d0f91ae2d3d5fdf802c18732114", "ja": "ふふ、やっぱり気付いたわね。\n可憐に教えてもらった、ローズマリーの香りよ。", "zh": "呵呵，果然还是被你发现了呢。\n这是可怜教我的迷迭香味哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "309b008da9cf149420729da51c217cd047554bbc7db53ceba9ae3dbd41d112e3", "ja": "律子さん……き、気に入ってもらえたんでしょうか……\nなんだか、とってもうれしいです……♪", "zh": "律子小姐……您、您喜欢这个味道吗……\n总觉得，真的好开心啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "76baaddc9c754d9ebaef8d9908cbf83f834892d588b1bfad452816058630a7b7", "ja": "ええ、そうなの。可憐にもつけてあげるわ。\n手首を出して……はい、どうぞ。", "zh": "嗯，是的。我也给可怜戴上一个吧。\n把手腕伸出来……来，给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "bd2d6aa9a7e1d6e5f9805582645eaee868ee7ea630f83492fd8b823f84a3b719", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……なんだか、\nいつもよりずっと、勇気が湧いてきます……！", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……不知怎么的，\n感觉比平时更加充满勇气了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "aa56e647c122ae8f92ef3a3d55d4fbabe3de1d3927115345cb79a317bd606003", "ja": "それならよかったわ。\n緊張しないのはいいけど、でも油断は禁物よ。", "zh": "那就好。  \n不紧张是好事，但也不能掉以轻心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4c0f0f1223d2506c1601abf077d058fe6cad233e0a0940c6829679ac3dba2667", "ja": "律子、可憐！\nもうすぐ出番だから、スタンバイしてくれ。", "zh": "律子、可怜！\n马上就该你们出场了，准备候场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "b7423e15555c39a9bb9cb990ed0d7b12e27b4a86af0dc48523e95f3bdb5d0ead", "ja": "あ、はーい！\nそれじゃ、行きましょうか。", "zh": "啊，好——！\n那么，我们走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "fb4e63725c1b2627cf4dead46328371a5cd254ef819eab368a7ffb690da40224", "ja": "は、はい！　あ、あの、律子さん……！\n公演が、無事に終わったら……お、お願いがあります。", "zh": "是、是的！　那、那个，律子小姐……！\n等公演顺利结束后……我、我有件事想拜托您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "496e3922be01ac891872aa4806a885a75488ac7bf488d37c9b86728752704a61", "ja": "わ……私と、デートしてください……！", "zh": "请……请和我约会吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "4edab0058d7f863aac5ad49cfe14c9b5dffbfffa1031bedd33ecf94cd32290e4", "ja": "で、デート！？", "zh": "约、约会！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "1a883f0d34129bb4042626f474649cfa42854b6d43d6c80de1a65afc99c56a51", "ja": "ごヒイキさま方、ありがとうございます！\n本日の私たちの舞台、いかがでしたでしょうか？", "zh": "各位贵宾，感谢你们的支持！\n今天我们的舞台，大家觉得怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1016_null", "source_sha256": "160d04390c1d43d1035f19afb6b5881a40fae00d7e2eea2baf4b5a8e6769b0a4", "ja": "ワーーーッ！", "zh": "哗───！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "286339b771ccba158087c2c204ac74ac288de919c73cafe2c576c68877508a59", "ja": "いっぱい応えんしてくれて、ありがとう！\nすっごく楽しかったよ♪", "zh": "谢谢大家这么卖力为我加油！\n玩得超级开心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "27337700936257eccc154470ab2c8c8d0e978a580cd48c2e399579477a12e39c", "ja": "それじゃ、次のメンバーにバトンタッチしますね。\nみなさん、最後まで楽しんでいってくださいね～。", "zh": "那么，接下来就把接力棒交给下一位成员啦。\n大家，请一直开心到最后哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "6bcd3459ed933562e7e3dfdb77aa23f010eb0070915085e4598c534fcb09d5de", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さんだ！\nおつかれさま！", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "48ffd8d42113d6bb6fc30929630013a924286db884b2cc6708f95ca2000e4e1d", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま！　育、いいステージだったよ。\nエミリーも、あずささんも。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了！育，你的舞台很棒。\n艾米莉，还有梓小姐也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "85b442604ed0a5e53abf995a3cd1a4f950447c8b7abca7313089cf721f6a8990", "ja": "そう言っていただけて、安心しました♪\n次はいよいよ、新曲のお披露目ですね！", "zh": "您能这么说，我就放心了♪\n接下来终于要公开演出新歌了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "0fd31797c08d5b42fb0e4814ab8e2305583df650336a83d702c0904fb78b7696", "ja": "律子さんも可憐ちゃんも、とっても\nいい顔してるわ。がんばってね。", "zh": "律子和可怜看起来状态都\n很不错呢。要加油哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "a25609ddce98103a5a36be7a50b2f47b03a5dc80ead32b9c7c6938f303e84dd4", "ja": "ありがとうございます、あずささん！\n育もエミリーも、ありがとう。", "zh": "谢谢您，梓小姐！\n育、艾米莉，也谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "c0874262d3ff4790b1d0f9156e94d8352250246ea9faf1ee0e26f905acdc6dd3", "ja": "{$P$}、今日は約束しますよ。\n可憐と最高のパフォーマンスをするのは、私だってね。", "zh": "{$P$}，今天我向你保证哦。和可怜一起完成最棒表演的人，也会是我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "ea48bd4092a06769ef6b0295d0077c368d855fb1fdd0e36ba0eec280c053040e", "ja": "り、律子さん……！", "zh": "律、律子小姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "e48d98a3022f4ea264af8e57a7e945e43ab97c6776c62d34d2960934abad23b6", "ja": "ああ、期待してる！\nふたりとも、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "啊，我很期待！\n你们两个，就拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0104_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "51d4ef44b868ef26b7bf4e9ed4898080d08cbbe17eafbaeb7bac16a356c88a8d", "ja": "（迷いのない足取りで、ステージに向かう。\n終わった後には、今日一番の歓声が上がりそうだな！）", "zh": "（迈着毫不犹豫的步伐走向舞台。\n结束之后，应该会响起今天最热烈的欢呼声吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
